<title>USA: Case Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Case Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Was. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $1.33		    $1.05</p>
<p> Net			 102,000		   78,000</p>
<p> Revs		    1,573,000		1,327,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   74,700		   72,500</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $4.17		    $4.60</p>
<p> Net			316,000		  337,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,409,000		5,105,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  74,000		   71,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 diluted shr $1.29 vs $1.02 year ago on 78.3 million shares vs 76.2 million shares. 1996 fully diluted share $4.06 vs $4.44 a year ago, on 77.7 million shrs vs 75.8 million.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
